  m_Name: CH2-LVL1-SCENE2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: 'Amid the rhythm of training, Atlas''s consciousness wavers. The present
      fades, giving way to visions vast and timeless. Before him, a cosmic ballet
      unfolds: two colossal celestial beings locked in fierce combat.'
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 651f8c6407d06472c820459941e2ea71, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: "Their clashes resonate with the fury of creation itself, turning the world
      into a chaotic wasteland. Just as quickly as it appeared, the vision recedes,
      leaving behind an echo of a cataclysm \u2014 the Skyfall"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 651f8c6407d06472c820459941e2ea71, type: 2}
    actions: []
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 188c295158b4647f1b6d5827ba7f2d6c, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 0}
